###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - GO-MACE-23 errors appear in both tables (max L = 1 column of Table 1 equals the GO-MACE-23 column of Table 2) and are encoded once. Errors are against rMD17's own DFT level, so they mix model and level-of-theory differences.
# - MACE-OFF23(L) and MACE-OFF24 comparisons, re-labelled DFT comparisons, fullerene-encapsulated molecules and fragmentation tests are shown only in figures. Validation errors on the GO data are in the SI (not read); hyperparameters of the other GNNs are in the SI.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/mahmoud2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

